WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:07.320
MARKUS KLUTE: Welcome
back to 8.701.

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:09.300
So in this short
video, we'll talking

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.480
about the effects
of renormalization

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.790
and higher-order QED diagrams.

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.010
And we have already
seen that when

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:23.580
we perform the integration
of a matrix element over q,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:25.230
that there's infinities.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:28.200
And those infinities
can be gotten around

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.320
with by introducing
a cut-off scale,

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:36.690
and then only integrating
up to this cut-off scale,

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:41.280
and in effect
renormalize or redefine

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.260
masses and couplings involved.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:47.880
So the first of such an
effect or effective higher

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:51.450
order is the so-called
vacuum polarization.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.460
So you have high-order
contribution

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:57.490
which may look like this,
an additional loop, which

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:01.480
you can think about in the
photon is so energetic that it

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.620
can polarize the
vacuum and produce

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.130
a particle-antiparticle pair.

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:09.760
And that particle
and antiparticle pair

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.640
then provides kind of a
screening of the charge

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:13.900
you want to probe.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:17.710
So I mentioned this
particle here emits a photon

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:22.770
and wants to probe the electric
charge of this particle.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:27.110
The fact that there is this
vacuum polarization going on

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:29.800
screens the charge you
actually want to probe.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:34.100
So effectively, you see
a charge which is either

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:37.010
reduced or increased,
depending on the impact,

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:39.470
on the sort of impact.

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:42.860
So the fine structure
constant, remember, alpha,

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:47.310
is 1/137 [INAUDIBLE] at 0.

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:52.730
We measure that the value of
alpha slightly increases as we

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:54.630
go to higher and
higher energies.

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:56.540
And so this has been
measured in many places,

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:58.910
experimentally
confirmed, for example,

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:02.030
at lab where, at the
[INAUDIBLE] of the W

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.150
or the scale of the W
mass, the value of alpha

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:07.850
has been measured to 1/128.

00:02:07.850 --> 00:02:09.560
And you can do
this analytically.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.670
You can calculate what the scale
of effect is and plot this.

00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:17.390
So you see here the running
of alpha QED as a function

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:18.510
of the energy scale.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:20.900
And you see this increase here.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:22.580
There's another
interesting point.

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:29.260
As you open up new particles
of higher masses, quark

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.970
and antiquark pairs,
you find this kind

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:33.950
of stepping approach here--

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:35.360
the new particles, for example.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:38.480
The muon, antimuon, and
the quarks and antiquarks

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:42.070
are [INAUDIBLE].

00:02:42.070 --> 00:02:42.640
All right.

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.010
So this is the first
effect, vacuum polarization.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:49.150
The second effect is very
interesting-- probably one

00:02:49.150 --> 00:02:53.530
of the most famous
higher-order processes in QED.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.890
And it has to do with the
anomalous magnetic moment.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.980
The magnetic moment is
defined as the factor

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:04.930
g times e over 2m times S,
the spin of the particle.

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:08.820
Diagrams of this form
here modify the vertex.

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:12.660
So instead of having
a vertex like this,

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:15.180
you have higher orders which
modify the [INAUDIBLE]..

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:22.020
This leads, then, to a
modified magnetic moment

00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.710
of the fermion involved--
in this case, an electron,

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:29.060
but it can also [INAUDIBLE]
muon or tau or another form.

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:33.420
So this was shown by
Schwinger already in 1948,

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:36.360
and then experimentally
confirmed many times after.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:40.830
This g minus [INAUDIBLE],,
which is 2, leading order,

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:47.170
is modified to 2 plus pi over
alpha in next leading order.

00:03:47.170 --> 00:03:49.830
We can calculate
this to many orders,

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:53.780
and with mind-blowing precision.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.480
So the precision is better
than 10 to the minus 12 pi now.

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.730
I think it's 1.7
[INAUDIBLE] at this stage.

00:04:00.730 --> 00:04:02.470
And experiments have
tried to measure

00:04:02.470 --> 00:04:04.290
this to find new effects.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.700
I mentioned you can
have new particles which

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:11.450
make modifications to
the magnetic moment here.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.520
And you would have
sensitivity by making

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.730
experimental measurements.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.630
So the electrons
[INAUDIBLE] muon g minus 2

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:20.329
has been measured with
very high precision.

00:04:20.329 --> 00:04:21.890
No new physics
have been observed,

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:28.340
but some differences
are small differences

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:32.630
that have caused
quite some excitement

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.810
about further improvements
in g minus 2 measurements

00:04:35.810 --> 00:04:37.170
specifically for the muon.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.000
So they're ongoing
at this point.

